{"parse":{"title":"The Balemoon Alone May Know","pageid":302310,"revid":1771321,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Balemoon Alone May Know</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015919\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent The Balemoon Alone May Know\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015919\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015919 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015919 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent The Balemoon Alone May Know\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent The Balemoon Alone May Know.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">While in combat, Arlecchino gains a 40% <span class=\"text-pyro\"><b>Pyro DMG Bonus</b></span> and can only be healed through <a href=\"/wiki/Balemoon_Rising\" title=\"Balemoon Rising\">Balemoon Rising</a>.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pyro_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pyro DMG Bonus\">Pyro DMG Bonus</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Balemoon Alone May Know</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" c