 will be restored.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>The Balemoon Alone May Know</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">唯厄月可知晓</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Èyuè Kě Zhīxiǎo</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Only the Balemoon May Know</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">唯厄月可知曉</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Èyuè Kě Zhīxiǎo</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">悟れるものは凶月のみ</span><br /><small><i>Satoreru Mono wa Kyougetsu nomi&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"&lt;sup&gt;&#91;!&#93;&lt;/sup&gt;\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><sup>[!]</sup></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Assumed reading</span></span>&#8205;</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">재액의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">달만이</span> <span lang=\"ko\">알</span> <span lang=\"ko\">수</span> <span lang=\"ko\">있다</span><br /><small><i>Jaeaegui Dalmani Al Su Itda</i></small></td><td>Only the Balemoon Can Know<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ko&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ko-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>• 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Solo la luna aciaga podr<span lang=\"es\">á</span> saber</td><td>Only the Bale Moon Will Know</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Seule la lune peut savoir</td><td>Only the Moon May Know</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Лишь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">роковой</span> <span lang=\"ru\">луне</span> <span lang=\"ru\">известно</span><br /><small><i>Lish' rokovoy lune izvestno</i></small></td><td>Only the &#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"&lt;span class=&quot;screen-reader-text&quot;&gt;Tooltip for &lt;span class=&quot;text-primary&quot;&gt;Balemoon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#9432;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino/Lore#Other_Languages\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arlecchino/Lore\"><span class=\"text-primary\">Balemoon</span></a>&#8201;<span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Tooltip for <span class=\"text-primary\">Balemoon</span></span>&#9432;</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">lit. \"fatal moon\"</span></span>&#8205; Knows</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>The Balemoon Alone May Know</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Chỉ Ách Nguyệt Mới Có Thể Thấu Hiểu</span></td><td>The Balemoon Alone May Understand</td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Nur der Mond des Verderbens wei<span lang=\"de\">ß</span></td><td>Only the Moon of Doom Knows</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>The Balemoon Alone May Know</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Somente a Lua Ominosa Sabe</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Yaln<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>zca U<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>ursuz Ay Bilebilir</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Cognizione della Luna cruenta</td><td>Bloody Moon's Cognition</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ko-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-ko_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><b>Korean:</b>&#160;Arlecchino's three Talents connect into a single sentence, \"Only Pain Can Repay, / Only Strength Can Defend, and / Only the Balemoon Can Know.\"</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/4.6\" title=\"Version/4.6\">Version 4.6</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/The_Balemoon_Alone_May_Know/Change_History?action